00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Jack Reacher is a crime, drama, thriller film directed by Christopher McQuarrie.

3
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:42,000
One morning in an ordinary town, five people are shot
dead in a seemingly random attack.

4
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:54,000
All evidence points to a single suspect: an ex-military
sniper who is quickly brought into custody.

5
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
The interrogation yields one written note: 'Get Jack Reacher!'.

6
00:31:12,000 --> 00:31:18,000
Reacher, an enigmatic ex-Army investigator, believes the authorities have the
right man but agrees to help the sniper's defense attorney.

7
00:36:24,000 --> 00:36:30,000
However, the more Reacher delves into the case, the less clear-cut it appears.

8
00:41:36,000 --> 00:41:42,000
So begins an extraordinary chase for the truth, pitting Jack Reacher against an
unexpected enemy, with a skill for violence and a secret to keep.

9
